    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attention:</h2><br>This game <strong>does not support matchmaking with random opponents</strong>. It is designed to be played solo or with your friends on Steam. You can try <strong>the demo version, which is identical to the main game</strong>, except that you cannot choose heroes. The demo version can also be played with your friends on Steam.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game:</h2><br>AutoHeroes is a \u2018one hero\u2019 autobattler with elements of roguelike and the ability to play in multiplayer. Control one of the four heroes who fight each other for the throne on random maps - both as each for themselves and as part of teams. Manage your hero through priority setting, as well as skill and equipment upgrades. Study your enemies and counter them with your plan!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403940/extras/1c9b0d318db30f9bd185b22422ace004.poster.avif?t=1721687488\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403940/extras/1c9b0d318db30f9bd185b22422ace004.webm?t=1721687488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403940/extras/1c9b0d318db30f9bd185b22422ace004.mp4?t=1721687488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The kingdom has lost its king and is in turmoil - no one understands what will happen next. Will the kingdom fall into the hands of a good hero, who will inspire the guard to serve him as the new king? Will the supporter of the dark forces, who prefers to rule the kingdom of the dead, prevail? Or maybe it will be that hero who combines both good and evil?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403940/extras/f422f0d355de9f51962b30252bcdb849.poster.avif?t=1721687488\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403940/extras/f422f0d355de9f51962b30252bcdb849.webm?t=1721687488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403940/extras/f422f0d355de9f51962b30252bcdb849.mp4?t=1721687488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Auto-battler: no rush during the game. <br></li><li>One hero: no armies, no &quot;deck-building&quot;\u200b - focus only on your hero.<br></li><li>Flexible settings: customize AI strength and teams, or invite friends to play PvE or PvP. <br></li><li>Priority system: regulate which objects and which enemies interest you first, and which last. <br></li><li>Skill wheel: choose skill schools and master them. Experiment and look for the best combinations. <br></li><li>Kindness or Malevolence: Persuade guards to join your cause or compel them to battle on your behalf even after their demise.<br></li><li>Assassin or Tactician: Choose to be an aggressor who strikes enemy heroes at the first chance or a strategist who benefits from prolonging each round.<br></li><li>Scouting: play for fun or seriously worry about countering your opponents.<br></li><li>Four heroes to choose from: warrior, archer, fire mage, or dark mage.<br></li><li>Random maps filled with enemies - each map is different from the previous one!<br></li><li>Fight with formidable opponents - dark knights, ghosts, even dragons!<br></li><li>Finally, fight your main enemy and main threat in all game modes - other AutoHeroes.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403940/extras/f8a867900ed3687d2a2d567243a7f354.poster.avif?t=1721687488\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403940/extras/f8a867900ed3687d2a2d567243a7f354.webm?t=1721687488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403940/extras/f8a867900ed3687d2a2d567243a7f354.mp4?t=1721687488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attention:</h2><br>This game <strong>does not support matchmaking with random opponents</strong>. It is designed to be played solo or with your friends on Steam. You can try <strong>the demo version, which is identical to the main game</strong>, except that you cannot choose heroes. The demo version can also be played with your friends on Steam.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game:</h2><br>AutoHeroes is a \u2018one hero\u2019 autobattler with elements of roguelike and the ability to play in multiplayer. Control one of the four heroes who fight each other for the throne on random maps - both as each for themselves and as part of teams. Manage your hero through priority setting, as well as skill and equipment upgrades. Study your enemies and counter them with your plan!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403940/extras/1c9b0d318db30f9bd185b22422ace004.poster.avif?t=1721687488\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403940/extras/1c9b0d318db30f9bd185b22422ace004.webm?t=1721687488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403940/extras/1c9b0d318db30f9bd185b22422ace004.mp4?t=1721687488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The kingdom has lost its king and is in turmoil - no one understands what will happen next. Will the kingdom fall into the hands of a good hero, who will inspire the guard to serve him as the new king? Will the supporter of the dark forces, who prefers to rule the kingdom of the dead, prevail? Or maybe it will be that hero who combines both good and evil?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403940/extras/f422f0d355de9f51962b30252bcdb849.poster.avif?t=1721687488\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403940/extras/f422f0d355de9f51962b30252bcdb849.webm?t=1721687488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403940/extras/f422f0d355de9f51962b30252bcdb849.mp4?t=1721687488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Auto-battler: no rush during the game. <br></li><li>One hero: no armies, no &quot;deck-building&quot;\u200b - focus only on your hero.<br></li><li>Flexible settings: customize AI strength and teams, or invite friends to play PvE or PvP. <br></li><li>Priority system: regulate which objects and which enemies interest you first, and which last. <br></li><li>Skill wheel: choose skill schools and master them. Experiment and look for the best combinations. <br></li><li>Kindness or Malevolence: Persuade guards to join your cause or compel them to battle on your behalf even after their demise.<br></li><li>Assassin or Tactician: Choose to be an aggressor who strikes enemy heroes at the first chance or a strategist who benefits from prolonging each round.<br></li><li>Scouting: play for fun or seriously worry about countering your opponents.<br></li><li>Four heroes to choose from: warrior, archer, fire mage, or dark mage.<br></li><li>Random maps filled with enemies - each map is different from the previous one!<br></li><li>Fight with formidable opponents - dark knights, ghosts, even dragons!<br></li><li>Finally, fight your main enemy and main threat in all game modes - other AutoHeroes.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403940/extras/f8a867900ed3687d2a2d567243a7f354.poster.avif?t=1721687488\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403940/extras/f8a867900ed3687d2a2d567243a7f354.webm?t=1721687488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403940/extras/f8a867900ed3687d2a2d567243a7f354.mp4?t=1721687488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "A Roguelike Autobattler, where you focus on the development and priority setting for a single hero. In each game, four competitors battle for the throne. You have the control to adjust the difficulty and teams, and even invite friends to join. Study your enemy's heroes and counter them!",
